sequenceDiagram
    participant C1 as User Client (Sender)
    participant S as Central Server
    participant P as Presence & Status Manager
    participant M as Message Routing Engine
    participant C2 as Target Client(s)
    participant A as Admin Console

    Note over C1, A: Authentication & Session Establishment
    C1->>S: Login Request (Credentials + LAN Context)
    S->>P: Register Presence & Issue Session Token
    P-->>C1: Connection Confirmed + User List Update
    P-->>A: Log Active User Event

    Note over C1, A: Real-Time Messaging Flow
    C1->>S: Encrypted Text Payload (Recipient/Group)
    S->>M: Route Message with Integrity Check
    M->>C2: Push Encrypted Payload via Persistent Channel
    C2-->>C2: Decrypt, Timestamp, Store in Session History
    C2-->>C1/C2: Display Notification + UI Update

    Note over C1, A: Presence & Recovery Monitoring
    C1->>S: Heartbeat Signal (Periodic)
    S->>P: Update Connection Status
    P-->>C2: Broadcast Online/Offline Indicator
    S->>A: Log Disconnection/Recovery Event

    Note over C1, A: Administration & Audit
    A->>S: Request Active User Inventory
    S->>P: Query Current Presence State
    P-->>A: Return Real-Time User List + Status